. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZWya0uQBjdMQ7kNvwEmE0QR&_nc_oc=AdpZUpsUuvhGjI2LztpqF02_5gFBo1lB0op62kEux5ClDTdcocH4pth0LUnEhtsohro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzkxcHGm8Fs29o044mn3nH3f_LeuNEgpc5cU62zPAKCIg&oe=69C139BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2bmhWrdLui8Q7kNvwFcxdf6&_nc_oc=AdrWJ0NCEf6xokMWMGnhnoncvbWbrlS3Pz9eij58MEk7Rol6S30yLI4t6z7z7Jb6-B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy_IQpmiMZ6GqHjPTOMKpHPv3mrfa-dMShoj3sNrYDP4Q&oe=69C1505E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=raJgrJJ_J9IQ7kNvwEBe9jJ&_nc_oc=AdqQYG6a8VSCR2QrLLD-bDfhBVbWGbxHq7_TQH--M-iddev4RwlxEviEhTN2MYIbypI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxJcEzpcRCY6btEy7C7OfbuvyMwihLvlLKs3jFp7xzVQg&oe=69C145DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3